config VOLTBALL_WAKE_TRACE
    bool "Log how long a half takes to come back after deep sleep"
    depends on ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL && BT_CENTRAL && LOG
    help
      Diagnostic build only. On the dongle, logs "[wake]" lines when a half's
      split advertisement is first seen, when it connects, when encryption and
      the connection interval are settled, and when its first key or trackball
      input arrives, with the time since the advertisement was seen.
